    {
      "id": "18198068950151972",
      "caption": "Dear Project Partners, \n\nOur institution, now known as INTPROMAN AB, has signed many successful European Union projects such as Leonardo da Vinci, Grant projects, Commenius, Gruntvig, Central Finance projects in Sweden since 2004 and has undertaken all services from the start of the project to the implementation. In our 16-year project implementation history, the number of projects that we have signed and achieved great success has exceeded thousands. \n\nAs of 2014, we continue to serve with our professional and experienced team for such projects that have transitioned to Erasmus + programs. We took the participants from Stockholm Arlanda airport and provided transportation, accommodation, guidance, translation, appointments of the institutions to be visited according to the project subject, all official documents and documents signed and completed by our partner institutions, breakfast, lunch and dinner services, and it continues. \n\nThe Work program of the project is implemented throughout the province, especially in the center of Stockholm, and in the surrounding provinces if needed for the efficiency of the project. Within the scope of the program, applications in enterprises, educational institutions and public institutions will be examined in relation to the project subject. \n\nOur guides accompany the participants during the project implementation, interpreting services are also provided to the participants during their institutional visits. As an institution that is proud to have hosted project teams from all 81 provinces of Turkey in Sweden, we are honored to host you with new project works and to work together. \n\nAt the same time, we are in communication with many experienced and professional project coordinators, institutions and friends in Europe and we are working together successfully. We are honored to work with you… \n\nGeneral Coordinator \nSabri Karadag \n\nSabri Karadag \nsabri@intproman.se \n\nIntproman AB \nInternational Project Management www.intproman.se info@intproman.se \n+46 723030125 \nStockholm / Sweden",
